# name: type text
# reps: 3
# The one click in this set. It puts focus in the editor body; every later driver
# reaches the end of the note with cmd+a then right, so nothing else has to guess
# where the text ends.
activate
click 50% 80%
sleep 400
type The vault is a folder of plain markdown files.
key return
sleep 400
type Links are what turn a pile of notes into a graph.
key return
sleep 400
type Typing is the action a learner performs most.
key return
